{"type": "text", "id": "card_body", "x": 102, "y": 604, "text": "the set-up → \"a multiplayer AI-native war room.\"\n\nthe role   → \"a driver to wield these expensive\n               AI tools,\"", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#f5ede4"},
